-- Preparing the game's data on the phone (phase 22, ROADMAP 22.7, ADR-0005 §8): with the WoW copied to the phone, the
-- first-run screen bakes the packs there (app/FirstRunScreens, app/PhoneBake) in a service of its own process, with a
-- notification (its texts travel to the service in the plan: apps/android/.../BakeService.java reads no table).
